    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83058" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίειρα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], ἡ</span>, fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίων</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fat,
			rich</i>, mostly of land, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρουρα
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.541
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.328
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.173
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				12.3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				111b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.6.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σικελία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					1.15
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαὶς π</span>. <i>rich,
			plenteous</i> meal, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.180
			</span></i>; of wood, <i>resinous, juicy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				766
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Puer.</u>
				26
			</span></i>; of doves, <i>plump</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				600a23
			</span></i>. (Cf. Skt. <i>pīívarī</i>,
			fem. of <i>pīívā</i>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίων</span>
			.)</div>
